  "goodToKnow": "Der Leitartikel is an editorial or leading article, expressing the newspaper's own view, usually on page one or two. Written by senior editors, it's distinct from der Bericht (report) and der Kommentar (signed opinion piece). Der Leitartikler is its author. German press ethics separate news and opinion clearly. The plural is the same: die Leitartikel."
